sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant UI as React client
  participant API as Express API
  participant AE as Analytics Engine
  participant MC as mlClient
  participant ML as FastAPI ML service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Note over S,DB: PLANNED flow (not implemented in the 25% build). Only the /ml/status health check exists today.
  S->>UI: open risk view
  UI->>API: GET /risk (planned)
  API->>AE: build feature vector from stored data
  AE-->>API: features
  API->>MC: predict(features)
  MC->>ML: POST /predict (timeout)
  alt ML service unavailable or slow
    ML--xMC: error / timeout
    MC-->>API: unavailable
    API-->>UI: 200 other data + "risk estimate unavailable"
  else ok
    ML-->>MC: class, probability, top factors
    API->>DB: INSERT risk_predictions
    API-->>UI: estimate with contributing factors
  end
